    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0888-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Thought to be via competitive inhibition of \nCYP1A2. Other drugs affected by caffeine-\ninduced inhibition of the enzyme include \nolanzapine, imipramine and clomipramine\n",
